title Home Assistant: an area's tab (Living room, Page Down five times): its lights, switch, scene, sensors and thermostat as tiles, by name; a dimmable light's slider row
sizes 480x320 640x480 800x480 1024x600 1280x720 1280x800 720x720 480x800 480x640 800x1280
env HA_DEMO home

wait 1600
key pgdn
key pgdn
key pgdn
key pgdn
key pgdn
wait 900
shot area
check area
expect text "Living room"
expect text "Ceiling light"
expect text "Humidity"
@800x480,1024x600,1280x720,1280x800,800x1280 expect text "48 %"
@800x480,1024x600,1280x720,1280x800,800x1280 expect text "Reading lamp"
# Page Up goes back one view at a time
key pgup
wait 700
shot area-kitchen
check area-kitchen
expect text "Kitchen"
@640x480,1024x600 expect text "Coffee machine"
expect text "Kitchen light"
# a sideways swipe on the grid switches views too (a convenience: Page Up / Down and the tabs do it as well)
@640x480 drag 0.85 0.38 0.15 0.38
@640x480 wait 700
@640x480 expect text "Ceiling light"
@640x480 expect text "Humidity"
@640x480 shot area-swiped
expect noquit
